WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:18.352
"I love field trips," said Eddy.

2
00:00:18.353 --> 00:00:20.659
"The new bridge will be cool.

3
00:00:20.660 --> 00:00:27.460
I can't wait to see it!"

4
00:00:27.461 --> 00:00:31.484
Everyone drove up a hill.

5
00:00:31.485 --> 00:00:42.472
"This hill is steep!" said Poppy.

6
00:00:42.473 --> 00:00:46.177
"I'm tired," said Jeb.

7
00:00:46.178 --> 00:00:49.072
"Me too," said Dipper.

8
00:00:49.073 --> 00:00:58.720
"I'm too tired to play music."

9
00:00:58.721 --> 00:01:02.295
"Up, up, up!" said Ms. Fender.

10
00:01:02.296 --> 00:01:06.221
"We're almost there!"

11
00:01:06.222 --> 00:01:22.481
"Ugh!" said Zippy.

12
00:01:22.482 --> 00:01:25.187
Eddy saw mountains.

13
00:01:25.188 --> 00:01:28.156
He felt the wind.

14
00:01:28.157 --> 00:01:33.140
"Wow!" he said.

15
00:01:33.141 --> 00:01:37.337
"Keep going, everyone!" said Ms. Fender.

16
00:01:37.338 --> 00:01:43.084
"The new bridge is close!"

17
00:01:43.085 --> 00:01:46.752
The road made a sharp turn.

18
00:01:46.753 --> 00:01:51.426
Then Eddy saw something red.

19
00:01:51.427 --> 00:01:54.298
"Whoa!" said Eddy.

20
00:01:54.299 --> 00:01:56.422
"The new bridge!"

21
00:01:56.423 --> 00:01:59.093
Ms. Fender smiled.

22
00:01:59.094 --> 00:02:06.585
"Here we are!" she said.

23
00:02:06.586 --> 00:02:13.754
"Who will go across first?"

